# The General's Secret (sandoria 60): Curilla in Chateau d'Oraguille, the Hot Springs in Horlais Peak. Fame 49 (level
# 1): her script's 530; fame 50 (level 2): a trade while available (nothing), 55 declined (nothing), 55 taken (begun,
# Curilla's Bottle empty); 53; the Hot Springs swap the bottle (empty deleted, full given), then nothing (nil: its
# default); Curilla's 54 (completed: Lynx Baghnakhs, fame +20, the full bottle deleted); then her script's 530.
# Curilla's script always starts an event (530 here); every reply of this quest is a Progress event, which wins. Her
# script has no onTrade. The Hot Springs have no script; default NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY. A WAR 10 meets no other
# Curilla quest (Old Wounds needs sword skill 240, Enveloped in Darkness an RDM 50).
lists ChateauDoraguille/Curilla/onTrigger ChateauDoraguille/Curilla/onTrade ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/55 ChateauDoraguille/onEventFinish/54 HorlaisPeak/Hot_Springs/onTrigger
char zone=ChateauDoraguille pos=29.2,0,1.1 job=WAR lvl=10
fame Sandoria 49
item BoneChip
login
trigger Curilla                           # fame level 1: not offered; her script's 530
finish
fame Sandoria 50
trade Curilla BoneChip x1                 # fame level 2, available: no trade handler: nothing
trigger Curilla                           # fame level 2: 55
finish                                    # option 0: nothing
trigger Curilla                           # 55
finish option=1                           # begun, Curilla's Bottle (empty)
trigger Curilla                           # accepted, no full bottle: 53
finish
warp 445.3,-37.75,-16.6 HorlaisPeak
trigger Hot_Springs                       # the empty bottle: deleted; the key item Curilla's Bottle (full)
trigger Hot_Springs                       # no empty bottle: nil; NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
warp 29.2,0,1.1 ChateauDoraguille
trigger Curilla                           # the full bottle: 54
finish                                    # completed: Lynx Baghnakhs, fame +20; the full bottle deleted
trigger Curilla                           # completed: no section; her script's 530
finish
warp 445.3,-37.75,-16.6 HorlaisPeak
trigger Hot_Springs                       # completed: no section; NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
